From: CarLink hardware bring-up
Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: use WuKongPi H3 vendor DRAM clock on Orange Pi Zero target

The WuKongPi H3 vendor configuration uses a 408 MHz DRAM clock.
Keep the current Orange Pi Zero target and its H3 defaults, but avoid
assuming the Orange Pi Zero's 624 MHz memory clock is valid on this board.
This is an initial bring-up setting, not a claim of board validation.

diff --git a/configs/orangepi_zero_defconfig b/configs/orangepi_zero_defconfig
--- a/configs/orangepi_zero_defconfig
+++ b/configs/orangepi_zero_defconfig
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 CONFIG_ARM=y
 CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI=y
 CONFIG_DEFAULT_DEVICE_TREE="sun8i-h2-plus-orangepi-zero"
-CONFIG_DRAM_CLK=624
+CONFIG_DRAM_CLK=408
 CONFIG_SPL=y
 CONFIG_MACH_SUN8I_H3=y
 # CONFIG_VIDEO_DE2 is not set
